 integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllRadioButtonComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide all tokens to the users."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RadioButtonComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"radio buttons","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Radio buttons","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SizeSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":") and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"borders ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BorderRadiusSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BorderWidthSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These components share the same type of tokens which are all gathered here."}],"type":"topic","title":"BlueCoatThemeRadioButtonComponentTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/BlueCoatThemeRadioButtonComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BlueCoatThemeRadioButtonComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BlueCoatThemeRadioButtonComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://MISOThemesM